      "writtenOn": "2024-02-22T04:25:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, I haven\u0027t.\n\nBut looks like `hci::GapData::Parse` is just a way to transform a byte stream of (len, type, data) into a GapData struct, so it will not solve the problem we have. If we\u0027re using it, I think we will just end up doing similar thing but with a slight different function call.\nFor example, [1] and [2] looks quite similar.\n\n[1] https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/stack/include/advertise_data_parser.h;l\u003d112;drc\u003dfe7a567aa50c966279d4d44ce0538dc1ae1b299c\n[2] https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/main/shim/utils.cc;l\u003d25;drc\u003d5b0977e64527539360b96649fd9a03078ba2de6f",
      "parentUuid": "63580843_4cf23579",
      "revId": "11ff04fce1626c851152017f7e1991348a97e539",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
